abstract: >-
  Reproducible Docker/Python harness for controlled ablation tests of Interface,
  Execution Pathway and Authority correspondence, covering fourteen configurations
  across the relation classes, both Authority forms and the Cut tests, with fixed
  predictions, run records and per-case assessment records.
